|---|---|---|
| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | LLM provider key | Yes (for AI) |
| `OPENAI_MODEL` | Model override | No |
| `DATABASE_URL` | PostgreSQL connection | Yes (for persistence) |
| `DATABASE_SSL_MODE` | SSL mode for DB | No |
| `DATABASE_SSL_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED` | TLS verification | No |
| `SESSION_SECRET` | HMAC signing key | Yes (for auth) |
| `SESSION_MAX_AGE_SECONDS` | Session TTL | No |
| `AUTH_ADMIN_EMAIL` / `AUTH_ADMIN_PASSWORD` | Admin credentials | No |
| `AUTH_OPERATOR_EMAIL` / `AUTH_OPERATOR_PASSWORD` | Operator credentials | No |
| `AUTH_VIEWER_EMAIL` / `AUTH_VIEWER_PASSWORD` | Viewer credentials | No |
| `PORTAL_AGENT_BEARER_TOKEN` | Portal API auth | No |
| `SIMULATOR_BEARER_TOKEN` | Simulator API auth | No |
| `ANALYTICS_INGEST_TOKEN` | Server analytics auth | No |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_INGEST_TOKEN` | Client analytics auth | No |
| `INCIDENT_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` | Slack alerts | No |
| `INCIDENT_WEBHOOK_URL` | Generic webhook | No |
| `INCIDENT_WEBHOOK_TOKEN` | Webhook bearer | No |
| `PAGERDUTY_ROUTING_KEY` | PagerDuty alerts | No |
| `INCIDENT_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_URL` | Email alerts | No |
| `INCIDENT_EMAIL_TO` / `INCIDENT_EMAIL_FROM` | Email routing | No |
| `ALERT_WARNING_FAILURE_RATE` | Metrics threshold | No |
| `ALERT_CRITICAL_FAILURE_RATE` | Metrics threshold | No |
| `ALERT_MIN_EVENTS` | Metrics threshold | No |
| `ALERT_MIN_CHAT_TO_LEAD_RATE` | Metrics threshold | No |

